# Local TESTNET reads additionally require BYETERY_SOURCE=TESTNET and
# BYETERY_DEPLOYMENT_ID=5c0cad2f-5f25-4216-8068-6cb9d2d26325.
# D2 HTTPS preview requires all of: BYETERY_WEB_ENV=D2_PREVIEW,
# BYETERY_SOURCE=TESTNET, BYETERY_DEPLOYMENT_ID, explicit BYETERY_WEB_ORIGIN,
# BYETERY_API_URL, BYETERY_ALLOWED_WEB_ORIGINS and BYETERY_ALLOWED_API_ORIGINS.
# Allowlists are JSON arrays of reviewed exact HTTPS origins, never wildcards.
# A real reachable authenticated HTTPS read API must exist before deployment.
# Never add DATABASE_URL, SERVICE_ROLE_KEY or any Stellar signing material here.
